sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User B viewer session
    participant B as Dicoogle backend
    participant K as Protected cache-key registry
    participant O as Shared OPFS
    participant C as Crypto and entry validator
    participant R as RAM cache
    participant W as Decoder worker
    participant V as Cornerstone
    Note over U,O: Same origin and browser profile/storage partition as cached User A data
    U->>B: Open Study X with User B session
    B->>B: Verify current permission and source/key version
    alt User B not authorised
        B-->>U: Deny new DEK access
        Note over U,O: No decryption by cooperative client; prior copied keys cannot be recalled
    else User B authorised
        B->>K: Fetch same scoped DEK or current key version
        K-->>B: DEK and key version
        B-->>U: DEK and trusted descriptor over HTTPS
        U->>C: Install volatile key and expected frame context
        U->>O: Read cached ciphertext
        O-->>U: Encrypted entry or miss
        U->>C: Check scope/version; verify AEAD before decode
        alt Valid current cache hit
            C-->>U: Verified plaintext frame bytes
        else Missing, stale or invalid cache entry
            C-->>U: Reject candidate; no decoded output
            U->>B: RetrieveFrames with authorised session
            B-->>U: Native frame bytes
            U->>C: Encrypt with fresh nonce and expected-context AAD
            C-->>U: Ciphertext envelope
            U->>O: Lock and publish complete replacement
        end
        U->>R: Store bounded plaintext for User B session
        R->>W: Decode native frame
        W-->>U: Decoded image
        U->>U: Reject result if session generation changed
        U->>V: Render active-session image
        U->>R: Clear plaintext on logout/study close
        U->>W: Reset/terminate managed worker state
        U->>V: Dispose viewport and owned decoded cache
        U->>C: Remove active key references
    end
